\p{Status: \strong{want}. Pocket-sized wireless successor to the base EINSTAR.
Wanted as the capture device feeding the \ref{scan-0000} pipeline — statues,
station furniture geometry ([[bcf-0043]]), and BCI mount/enclosure scanning
([[bcf-0037]]). Street price ~$1,635 (base non-Rockit EINSTAR ~$999).}

\p{Enters the daily possible-world rotation ([[bcf-devices]]): its
\code{1500-1700 USD} range overlaps within 1.5x with the second Cyton+Daisy
rig (\code{1650 USD}) and HackEEG (\code{300-500 USD} — no overlap), so expect
it to pair against the mid-cost cluster.}
